{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d00932a11fbc5643ff7a2b03b0d21e3ee6c8a18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^{48}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"19\" /> is exactly divisible by two numbers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. These numbers are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba9bc526fea17eb4bb2ca85d3e687124299fe7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }61,63\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }61,65\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }63,65\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }63,67\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }67,69$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"529\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factor repeatedly with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/7/057771652d2f4550e05e5e5407d9ad6ffcf800db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^{48}-1 = (2^{24}+1)(2^{12}+1)(2^{6}+1)(2^6-1)\\]\" width=\"337\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We only care about two terms: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/818c4ff2556e9f03686fc51586c5c4d9608d5a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cb34a77ed973b2e031e7b592a86c928edf4ac3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />. These simplify to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339baf6df71777af266e6259546917b0742caf2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6a1196ced71199df80a58c1ffa0de72f8c2b37e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }63,65}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"98\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?